LotteryController ..> CampsiteRepository
LotteryController ..> LotteryRepository
LotteryDetailsController ..> LotteryRepository
LotteryDetailsController ..> ProfileRepository
LotteryDetailsController ..> CampsiteRepository
LotteryDetailsController ..> LotteryDrawer
WaitingListController ..> LotteryRepository
WaitingListController ..> ProfileRepository
ReserveController ..> CampsiteRepository
ReserveController ..> LotteryRepository
ReserveController ..> ReservationRepository
